WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:14.493
"I love the beach!" Dipper said.

2
00:00:14.494 --> 00:00:17.244
"Me too," Eddy said.

3
00:00:17.245 --> 00:00:25.176
"The sun feels warm."

4
00:00:25.177 --> 00:00:28.444
"This is boring," Zippy said.

5
00:00:28.445 --> 00:00:33.981
"I can't go fast on sand!"

6
00:00:33.982 --> 00:00:40.739
The cars were on a field trip.

7
00:00:40.740 --> 00:00:50.723
They were at Tire Town Beach.

8
00:00:50.724 --> 00:00:55.729
"The water looks fun," said Dipper.

9
00:00:55.730 --> 00:00:58.625
Ms. Fender frowned.

10
00:00:58.626 --> 00:01:00.135
"Don’t forget.

11
00:01:00.136 --> 00:01:08.610
Cars cannot go in the water."

12
00:01:08.611 --> 00:01:11.365
Jeb dug sand.

13
00:01:11.366 --> 00:01:18.481
He loaded it in Eddy's dumper.

14
00:01:18.482 --> 00:01:21.566
A boat floated on the sea.

15
00:01:21.567 --> 00:01:24.110
"Wow," Dipper said.

16
00:01:24.111 --> 00:01:26.530
"I wish we could float."

17
00:01:26.531 --> 00:01:28.611
Poppy nodded.

18
00:01:28.612 --> 00:01:31.941
"The water looks fun," she said.

19
00:01:31.942 --> 00:01:35.663
"It sure does!" Gasser said.

20
00:01:35.664 --> 00:01:41.272
Gasser looked around.

21
00:01:41.273 --> 00:01:45.888
"I don't see Ms. Fender," he said.

22
00:01:45.889 --> 00:01:48.323
Brumm, brumm!

23
00:01:48.324 --> 00:01:52.655
Gasser went fast.

24
00:01:52.656 --> 00:01:57.200
Gasser zoomed through the water.

25
00:01:57.201 --> 00:02:02.135
It splashed everyone!

